// SPECIES: { id, name, kind, habitat[], where?[[lat, lon, radius_m]], months[1..12], hours[start, end],
//            rarity 1..5, note, look: { colour, size_m, form } }
//   hours are local clock hours; start > end means the window wraps past midnight (e.g. [19, 6]).
//   rarity: 1 everywhere / every visit, 2 common in its habitat, 3 needs the right place or
//   month, 4 lucky, 5 legendary (a once-a-game sighting).
//   where is optional: without it, spawn by habitat. With it, spawn only inside those circles.
// TRAILS: { name, lat, lon, note }  (note: a line a guide character could say)
